  "title": "Brussels Sprouts Caesar",
  "description": "Roasted Brussels sprouts are tossed with heavy cream, paprika, and lemon to make this tangy and smoky side dish with Caesar salad notes.",
  "authors": [
    "Allen Norvick"
  ],
